  m_Name: unit_831018
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Somber Guardian Angahl
  unitId: 831018
  unitNumber: 8660
  description: A fiercely loyal retainer of a minor house in the kingdom, Angahl
    had humble beginnings as the eldest son in a peasant family of five. Robust and
    healthy since childhood, his size and strength made him ideal for manual labor.
    A traveling noble and his entourage chanced to witness the lad's impressive feat
    of wrestling a ferocious boar to the ground, and offered to hire him as a bodyguard
    with the promise of a better life.Angahl grew to be a stoic man of few words,
    but displayed surprising gentleness toward his charge, the young lady Phaedra.
    His brooding demeanor frightened the girl at times, however, and Angahl soon
    learned to keep his watch at a distance. Nevertheless, a silent friendship blossomed
    between the two, and he would come to consider himself her stalwart guardian.When
    Baelfyr and his Wolf's Eyes ordered an assault on the Vale, Angahl received a
    missive from his lord to secret Phaedra away once she arrived at the forward
    camp in the guise of a new recruit. Soon after, a violent confrontation exploded
    into ceaseless fighting, and Angahl was deployed to the frontlines as a mobile
    shield. His penchant for holding any line earned him the epithet 'unbreakable',
    but none would predict the Wolf's Eyes turning on them instead.Left at the mercy
    of the enraged elementals, Angahl broke ranks to rescue Phaedra in the chaos,
    and that was the last anyone would ever see of him. Some say the earth howled
    with vengeance and swallowed men whole that day; others insist he was truly unbreakable,
    and to this day wanders the ruins a haunted shell of a man, forever in search
    of his missing charge...
  summonDesc: '*huff*<br>Friend?... Or foe?'
  fusionDesc: '*snort*<br>Many...thanks.'
  evoDesc: '*growl*<br>Enemies abound...<br>I''ve got...you covered!'
